7
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:12,834
But according to
Arby’s parent company,

8
00:00:12,874 --> 00:00:15,388
the name refers to
the Raffel Brothers:

9
00:00:15,428 --> 00:00:16,950
Leroy and Forrest.

10
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:20,343
They founded the
restaurant in Boardman,

11
00:00:20,383 --> 00:00:21,810
